# Shattering Stars (jeuno 132) accepted (a GM) by level 66 chars of the jobs Balga's Dais serves: MNK (2), WHM (3), SMN (15),
# one char each (main the first). Each trades its job's testimony (64 with its job id) and answers 1: tradedTestimony
# 1, set down at Balga's Dais (299.316 -123.591 353.760, zone 146); the char zones at the next tick.
# Then each char, in the flow's order, enters its own Maat fight in its own area (1, 2, 3: the fights of one zone
# run side by side): a GM warp by BC_Entrance (the flow parser follows zones by warp), the testimony traded (the 32000
# menu), 32000 updated with option index * 16 + area (registered, entered; the testimony wears), finished; that
# area's Maat "killed" (unkillable: 1 HP; he yields, battlefield:win, at a later onMobFight, so some kills take ticks
# before the 32001 opens; battlefieldWin the fight's id), and the win's 32001 finished: accepted, so a Scroll of
# Instant Warp, Prog = the job id, the job's maatsCap bit (1 << (job - 1): a fresh char's maatsCap is 0), Maat Masher.
lists RuludeGardens/Maat/onTrade RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/64 BalgasDais/BC_Entrance/onTrade BalgasDais/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=MNK lvl=66
char whm zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=WHM lvl=66
char smn zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=SMN lvl=66
levelcap 70
quest Jeuno.ShatteringStars accepted
item MonksTestimony
whm: levelcap 70
whm: quest Jeuno.ShatteringStars accepted
whm: item WhiteMagesTestimony
smn: levelcap 70
smn: quest Jeuno.ShatteringStars accepted
smn: item SummonersTestimony
login
trade Maat MonksTestimony x1            # MNK's testimony, Prog 0: 64 (2)
finish option=1                         # tradedTestimony 1; set down at Balga's Dais
tick 400
login                                   # in Balga's Dais
whm: login
whm: trade Maat WhiteMagesTestimony x1  # WHM's testimony, Prog 0: 64 (3)
whm: finish option=1                    # tradedTestimony 1; set down at Balga's Dais
tick 400
whm: login                              # in Balga's Dais
smn: login
smn: trade Maat SummonersTestimony x1   # SMN's testimony, Prog 0: 64 (15)
smn: finish option=1                    # tradedTestimony 1; set down at Balga's Dais
tick 400
smn: login                              # in Balga's Dais
warp 300.4,-124.1,341.3 BalgasDais      # by BC_Entrance
trade BC_Entrance MonksTestimony x1     # tradedTestimony 1: the 32000 menu
update 32000 option=81                  # Shattering Stars (MNK), index 5, area 1: registered, entered
finish                                  # in the arena
kill MAAT                               # Maat (MNK) of area 1: won, battlefieldWin 101, 32001 opens
finish                                  # 32001, accepted: the scroll, Prog 2, maatsCap 2, Maat Masher
whm: warp 300.4,-124.1,341.3 BalgasDais # by BC_Entrance
whm: trade BC_Entrance WhiteMagesTestimony x1  # tradedTestimony 1: the 32000 menu
whm: update 32000 option=98             # Shattering Stars (WHM), index 6, area 2: registered, entered
whm: finish                             # in the arena
whm: kill MAAT+4                        # Maat (WHM) of area 2: 1 HP (unkillable), won once he yields, battlefieldWin 102
tick 1000                               # Maat is unkillable: he yields (battlefield:win) in a later onMobFight; 32001 opens on the last tick
tick 1000
tick 1000
whm: finish                             # 32001, accepted: the scroll, Prog 3, maatsCap 4, Maat Masher
smn: warp 300.4,-124.1,341.3 BalgasDais # by BC_Entrance
smn: trade BC_Entrance SummonersTestimony x1  # tradedTestimony 1: the 32000 menu
smn: update 32000 option=115            # Shattering Stars (SMN), index 7, area 3: registered, entered
smn: finish                             # in the arena
smn: kill MAAT+10                       # Maat (SMN) of area 3: won, battlefieldWin 103, 32001 opens
smn: finish                             # 32001, accepted: the scroll, Prog 15, maatsCap 16384, Maat Masher
